{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "I found a few minutes today to finally add search to Atlanta Startup Jobs.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3517aaa9bb750febfe1c71f06eec7dd73d0e450965edfbeeb1b0f43a613af24b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.5], [3, 0.5, 0.64], [4, 0.64, 0.84], [5, 0.84, 1.22], [6, 1.22, 1.42], [7, 1.42, 1.8], [8, 1.8, 2.1], [10, 2.42, 2.7], [11, 2.7, 2.98], [13, 3.56, 3.92]]}, {"text": "I had been putting it off for a long time, thinking it would be a long laborous process, but I found it was shockingly easy.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/58e7a7314fa221cb79256e3b7fa656943e3600c70324752e9e6d07083016b1d0.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.42], [3, 0.42, 0.64], [4, 0.64, 0.82], [5, 0.82, 0.96], [6, 0.96, 1.12], [7, 1.12, 1.2], [8, 1.2, 1.38], [9, 1.38, 1.72], [10, 2.02, 2.26], [11, 2.26, 2.44], [12, 2.44, 2.54], [13, 2.54, 2.68], [14, 2.68, 2.8], [15, 2.8, 2.96], [17, 3.38, 3.76], [18, 4.38, 4.58], [19, 4.58, 4.68], [20, 4.68, 4.88], [21, 4.88, 5.02], [22, 5.02, 5.14], [23, 5.14, 5.6], [24, 5.6, 6.0]]}, {"text": "Here is what I did:", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/5f986205f78dc2adf1869385dd4870f1392fe2f3230a4852cd28568817106a2b.mp3"}, {"text": "Install pg_search", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2b7bcb66aa8369b79923085b5668e8522afc58e28914d6e533296b305dd59975.mp3"}, {"text": "The two leading gems that drive postgress fulltext search are pg_search and textacular.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b44683876878a892093d44c7425b0147f83105193843c79848a510c5fb5f918c.mp3"}, {"text": "I went with pg_search, because it has more love on github.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/72f6adf0c50820e5bd5fbd50ebc7e344a844e1a80cc7b33b8826f9e7cc9355b1.mp3"}, {"text": "```ruby Gemfile gem ‘pg_search’", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7d315467950de607bd5a3152522e2870ea0b1829d6107ba0647e7d5a24244e0b.mp3"}, {"text": "Modify model", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6eb21c45eb249a6706d4fbf9c671629692271651692aae3d8700d199c7b7e0c9.mp3"}, {"text": "For the models you want to search, add include PgSearch to the top of them in order to enable the pg_search DSL.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/65afc8bfba4f81862183b069e0ca2578f39e9b7e6743c2a3ce61cd92cc18afbc.mp3"}, {"text": "Since Atlanta Startup Jobs only has one searchable model (job_posts), I include this line in the model:", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/76c416f6564f4109862ef2e57d2d081e7c8b775e3b510458be4cb8600e174f5a.mp3"}, {"text": "```ruby Gemfile pg_search_scope :search_generic, :against => [:title, :company_name, :description], :order_within_rank => “created_at DESC”", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b4bdbe0e8e933179293c2400718f88c72108ddd496a6b0a86a46f8f53712e4d0.mp3"}]}